[1, ["b", "bn1006802329503024333"], ["u", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description"], ["l", "This property refers to a geographic region that is covered by the Dataset. This property may be indicated using an IRI reference or may be encoded as an instance of dct:Location . CV to be used for IRI reference: LINDAS resources SHOULD be used. Whenever a particular location is not available as LINDAS resource, then the EU Vocabularies Named Authority Lists MAY be used: [[VOCAB-EU-CONTINENT]], [[VOCAB-EU-COUNTRY]], [[VOCAB-EU-PLACE]], if the location is not in one of the mentioned EU Vocabularies, then Geonames URIs MAY be used: [[GEONAMES]]. For the encoding as instance of dct:Location see the class Location ( DCAT-AP - 7.12 Location ).", "en", ""]]
