[1, ["b", "bn1006802329503024340"], ["u", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description"], ["l", "This property refers to a knowledge organization system used to classify the catalog's resources. A resource may be associated with multiple themes. There MUST be at least one entry using the EU Themes Vocabulary to be DCAT-AP conform: [[VOCAB-EU-THEME]] It is possible (CAN) to add additional topics by using other commonly used controlled vocabularies. Inherited from dcat:Resource.", "en", ""]]
